{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_26", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_26.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "CAPTAIN HORSTER", "names": ["CAPTAIN HORSTER"], "gender": "?", "first": 44, "spoke": 0}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "2nd Citizen (to BILLING).", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing, you go to their house\u2014have you ever noticed if the fellow drinks?", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Well I'm hanged if I know what to say.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "There are always spirits on the table when you go.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "3rd Citizen.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "I rather think he goes quite off his head sometimes.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "1st Citizen.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "I wonder if there is any madness in his family?", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "I shouldn't wonder if there were.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "4th Citizen.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "No, it is nothing more than sheer malice; he wants to get even with somebody for something or other.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Well certainly he suggested a rise in his salary on one occasion lately, and did not get it.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "The Citizens (together).", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah!\u2014then it is easy to understand how it is!", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "The Drunken Man (who has got among the audience again).", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "I want a blue one, I do!", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "And I want a white one too!", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Voices.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "It's that drunken chap again!", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Turn him out!", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil. (going up to DR. STOCKMANN).", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, Stockmann, do you see what these monkey tricks of yours lead to?", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "I have done my duty.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "What was that you said about the tanneries at Molledal?", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "You heard well enough.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "I said they were the source of all the filth.", "para": 13, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "My tannery too?", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Unfortunately your tannery is by far the worst.", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Are you going to put that in the papers?", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "I shall conceal nothing.", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "That may cost you dearly, Stockmann.", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "(Goes out.)", "para": 18, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "A Stout Man (going UP to CAPTAIN HORSTER, Without taking any notice of the ladies).", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, Captain, so you lend your house to enemies of the people?", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "I imagine I can do what I like with my own possessions, Mr. Vik.", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "The Stout Man.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "Then you can have no objection to my doing the same with mine.", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "What do you mean, sir?", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "The Stout Man.", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "You shall hear from me in the morning.", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "(Turns his back on him and moves off.)", "para": 23, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Was that not your owner, Captain Horster?", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, that was Mr. Vik the shipowner.", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen (with the voting-papers in his hands, gets up on to the platform and rings his bell).", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Gentlemen, allow me to announce the result.", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "By the votes of every one here except one person\u2014", "para": 26, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "A Young Man.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "That is the drunk chap!", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "By the votes of everyone here except a tipsy man, this meeting of citizens declares Dr. Thomas Stockmann to be an enemy of the people.", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "(Shouts and applause.)", "para": 28, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "Three cheers for our ancient and honourable citizen community!", "para": 28, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "(Renewed applause.)", "para": 28, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "Three cheers for our able and energetic Mayor, who has so loyally suppressed the promptings of family feeling!", "para": 28, "sent": 5, "present": [0]}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "(Cheers.)", "para": 28, "sent": 6, "present": [0]}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "The meeting is dissolved.", "para": 28, "sent": 7, "present": [0]}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "(Gets down.)", "para": 28, "sent": 8, "present": [0]}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "Three cheers for the Chairman!", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "The whole crowd.", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "Three cheers for Aslaksen!", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "Hurrah!", "para": 30, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "My hat and coat, Petra!", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "Captain, have you room on your ship for passengers to the New World?", "para": 31, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "For you and yours we will make room, Doctor.", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (as PETRA helps him into his coat), Good.", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Come, Katherine!", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "Come, boys!", "para": 33, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (in an undertone).", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "Thomas, dear, let us go out by the back way.", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "No back ways for me, Katherine, (Raising his voice.)", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "You will hear more of this enemy of the people, before he shakes the dust off his shoes upon you!", "para": 35, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "I am not so forgiving as a certain Person; I do not say: \"I forgive you, for ye know not what ye do.\"", "para": 35, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen (shouting).", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "That is a blasphemous comparison, Dr. Stockmann!", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "It is, by God!", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "It's dreadful for an earnest man to listen to.", "para": 37, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "A Coarse Voice.", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "Threatens us now, does he!", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "Other Voices (excitedly).", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "Let's go and break his windows!", "para": 39, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "Duck him in the fjord!", "para": 39, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "Another Voice.", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "Blow your horn, Evensen!", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "Pip, pip!", "para": 40, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 105, "kind": "action", "text": "(Horn-blowing, hisses, and wild cries.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 106, "kind": "action", "text": "DR. STOCKMANN goes out through the hall with his family, HORSTER elbowing a way for them.)", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 107, "kind": "action", "text": "The Whole Crowd (howling after them as they go).", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 108, "kind": "action", "text": "Enemy of the People!", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 109, "kind": "action", "text": "Enemy of the People!", "para": 42, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 110, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing (as he puts his papers together).", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 111, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, I'm damned if I go and drink toddy with the Stockmanns tonight!", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 112, "kind": "action", "text": "(The crowd press towards the exit.", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 113, "kind": "action", "text": "The uproar continues outside; shouts of \"Enemy of the People!\" are heard from without.)", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}]}